  << /ActualText (UX\057UI designer on an early\055stage fintech product\054 where I design the flows and screens and build the UI in code myself\056 At Broadcust\054 a B2B marketing platform\054 I found where users got stuck and proposed fixes that cut repeat status inquiries by about 20\045\056 Before moving to tech\054 I spent ten years designing customer experiences at H\046M and IKEA\056\nMaximalist in my closet\054 not in my interfaces\056)
