1026 0 obj
  << /ActualText (UX\057UI Designer\054 Fintech Startup \050stealth\051\054 Oct 2026\055Present\nOwn the UX\057UI for an early\055stage fintech product\054 from user flows to final screens\nBuild the UI in code myself with Claude Code\054 and work with the developer through GitHub\n\nDigital Creative Designer \046 Customer Success\054 Broadcust \050B2B platform\051\054 2024\0552026\nAnalyzed discovery calls\054 onboarding sessions and support tickets\054 and identified 4 key friction points that pushed customers off the platform\nProposed and defined a request\055status experience modeled on real\055time order tracking \050like Wolt\051\056 After the developer built it\054 repeat status inquiries dropped about 20\045\nDefined a simpler content\055request flow \050new\055request button\054 quick edit\051\056 10\05515\045 of subscribers used it in its launch month\nProposed replacing a 15\05530 minute discovery call with a self\055serve digital form and wrote its questionnaire\056 Most clients completed it on their own\nPresented proposals to the CEO with annotated briefs for the developer\nDesigned responsive landing pages and brand sites for clients\054 using AI tools)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1027 0 R
     /Pg 1002 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

